#  Konstructz blog admin
#
#  Copy this file to `.env.local` for local dev (Vite auto-loads it):
#    cp .env.example .env.local
#  …then paste the two values from your Supabase project (Project Settings →
#  API). The anon key is safe to ship to the browser — row-level security
#  guards every write.
#
#  For Hostinger production: set both vars in hPanel → Hosting → Advanced →
#  Environment Variables, then trigger a fresh `npm run build`. Vite inlines
#  them at build time, so a rebuild is required when either value changes.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

